​Top (4 Nozzles): Positioned along the dorsal spine to push the ship downward, countering sudden upward lift or pitching during atmospheric entry.
​Bottom (4 Nozzles): Positioned along the ventral hull (integrated near the 4x4 hatch and landing gear) to provide immediate upward counter-thrust and cushion landings.
