​Plasma Boost Exhaust Brakes: Modeled after high-performance vehicle exhaust mufflers, these dual rear-vented chambers mix compressed air with superheated plasma right before release. When triggered, they create a controlled, high-velocity plasma back-blast that acts as an aerodynamic reverse thruster—stopping the ship instantly in any flight situation without thermal blowout.
